	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><persName ref="p2463">Hein<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>r<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>i<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>chu<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>s <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Pantaleon</persName> charissimo D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> episcopo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>S. Quanquam singularis quędam benevolentia et humanitas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> ex aequo omnibus ingenita esse videatur, tua tamen, venerande <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>pręsul cęterorum longe post se relinquit eoque longius, quo eruditio, mores <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vitaeque tuę conditio eos omnes superat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod quidem cum nimis, quam ferat <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>personę meę exiguitas, nuper expertus sim, non potui non meas quoque <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>(licet novus homo accusari possi) ad te dare literas, quo et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>gratias tuę humanitati agerem maximas promptumque meum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>erga te tuosque animum aperirem in omnibus, quae amicus ab amico <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vel potest vel vult petere, inquam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Propterea <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>i virtute<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s et humanitatem omnibus praedico, commendo, iterum atque iterum inculco <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>easque maiores, quam vel fama unquam extulerit, esse inquio, nec est, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quod quis me assentationis insimulet; res ipsa loquitur et ab aliis quandoque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>intelliges etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Novarum rerum heu plus nimium hic feruntur, velimque <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tandem earum esse modum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> hoc die, quo scribo, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>venit paulo ante meridiem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Aiunt et <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName> aufugisse et vix <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in arcem quandam a bono viro quopiam receptum; an autem factum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>laudandum sit, tibi tuique similibus comitto iudicandum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus suos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ministros corroboret spiritu, quo veritatis confessione ad finem perseverent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/><placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName>, <placeName ref="l569">Wormatia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l513">Ulma</placeName>, <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberga</placeName>, etc. in Interim consensere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Quod idem <persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName> duci <placeName ref="l572">Wirtembergensi</placeName> nuper misit; dux concionatores <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et praefectos convocavit, a Caesare relaxationem petiit magna Caesaris <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>admiratione.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Legatis in mandatum dedit, ut continuo revertantur, si <persName>Caesarem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>offensum videant, aliud deliberaturus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> (dicunt quidam) <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>repulisse Interim, alii idem negant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hoc constat omnes fere cives ira <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>aestuare quasi, tamen prae formidine vix hiscere audere; ut enim corpus <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><placeName ref="l2481">Svevum</placeName> refert, sic et animum habent lepore formidolosiorem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Deinde <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>aiunt <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergam</placeName> a <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> defecisse; an autem sit certo, pollicer<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>i (ut nec priora) hisce temporibus vix audeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quod ad nos attinet, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>omnes gratia deo firmiter evangelio adhaeremus, magistratus, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>concionatores et cives; utinam et idem fiat, si tecta nostra fors ardere <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>incipiant.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Haec habui.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Oro tandem, ornatissime vir, ut chrono<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>logiam tuam, opus ut utile sic honestissimum, ad finem celerius perducas, quo omne<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>s videant non solum nostro tempore, sed et olim pios esse et fuisse <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>semper contemptos et minime paucos; at noctes atque dies patet atra <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ianua Ditis etc.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Me enim mei laboris fere poenitere cepit, postquam te <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>manum admovisse tabulę huic senserim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino et <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Christum defendere perge.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta D. <persName ref="p167">Ammianum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p1214">Phrysium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> omnesque fideles in vinea domini.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Datę <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> tert<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>io die idus iulii anno 1548.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">In <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>festo D. <persName ref="p2463">Heinrichi</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Moribus et literis conspicuo viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>D. magistro <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię preęsuli, in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri suo colendissimo etc.</s>
				</p>
